{
  "title": "GraphicsShape",
  "description": "A retained drawing of a borrowed source shape. Geometry edits are live; local fill overrides are independent of other drawings of the same source. The handle is removed, and GraphicsShape.removed turns `true`, when its Graphics is cleared or destroyed, or when the source shape itself is destroyed. Removing a drawing never destroys the source.",
