          "returnType": "this",
          "description": "Subtract a borrowed closed shape from this drawing only. Several cuts remove their union. Edits to the cut are live; destroying it drops the cut again. The source and the cut shape themselves are never modified. Throws for a removed drawing, a cut that is already applied, the drawing's own source, and a path with an open subpath."
